## **SECTION 5: EDGE CASES & ERROR HANDLING MATRIX**
*[Primary Assignment: Gemini - Comprehensive Edge Cases | Secondary: Kimi - Error Recovery]*

### 5.1 API & Network Edge Cases
| Scenario | Detection | Handling Strategy |
|----------|-----------|-------------------|
| **Rate Limiting (429)** | HTTP status | Exponential backoff (2s, 4s, 8s) + Toast "Too many requests" |
| **Invalid API Key (401)** | HTTP status | Redirect to onboarding, clear cached key |
| **File Too Large (413)** | HTTP status | Split audio (if >25MB) or compress to FLAC |
| **Network Timeout** | IOException | Queue for retry, save to disk, notify user |
| **Partial Transcription** | 200 with warning | Append "..." to text, log warning |
| **Quota Exhausted** | 429 + error msg | Show billing link, disable recording temporarily |

### 5.2 Audio Edge Cases
| Scenario | Detection | Handling Strategy |
|----------|-----------|-------------------|
| **Silent Recording** | RMS < -40dB for 3s | Discard, show "No speech detected" |
| **Clipping/Distortion** | Peak amplitude > 0dB | Show warning "Please speak softer" |
| **Hardware Unavailable** | AudioRecord initialization fail | Fallback to MediaRecorder, notify degradation |
| **Bluetooth Mic** | Audio routing change | Restart recording with new source, or block BT |
| **Phone Call Interruption** | TelephonyManager state | Auto-stop recording, discard buffer (privacy) |
| **Backgrounding** | onTrimMemory | Save state, finish recording if possible |

### 5.3 IME Framework Edge Cases
| Scenario | Detection | Handling Strategy |
|----------|-----------|-------------------|
| **Keyboard Hidden** | onFinishInputView | Stop recording immediately (privacy) |
| **Screen Rotation** | Configuration change | Save state in onCreateInputView bundle |
| **Multiple Input Fields** | onStartInput | Reset state, check new field inputType |
| **Password Field** | InputType variation | Show "Voice disabled for security" banner |
| **Incognito Mode** | EditorInfo.IME_FLAG_NO_PERSONALIZED_LEARNING | Disable cloud API, show local-only warning |
| **Low Memory** | onTrimMemory | Clear audio buffer, stop non-essential animations |

### 5.4 User Interaction Edge Cases
- **Rapid Tap:** Debounce 300ms to prevent state machine corruption
- **Swipe from Keyboard:** Detect gesture to close keyboard (finishInput)
- **Long Press Backspace:** Repeat deletion (100ms interval after 500ms hold)
- **Double-tap Space:** Insert period + space (configurable in settings)

